{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>For</b> — I said in my heart: the lovingkindness of HaShem stands forever, built. And behold, יבנה [will be built], like: \"and I will build your throne for generation after generation.\" Selah. And your faithfulness — it is established in the heavens. The meaning: as the heavens stand, so your faithfulness stands. And this lovingkindness and this faithfulness are what You said."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 89, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:24.349503325Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}